    "flavor_text_entries": [
      {
        "flavor_text": "Il a évolué après avoir mangé une pomme sucrée. Il attire ses proies, les Pokémon Insecte, en dégageant un parfum mielleux.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Eating a sweet apple caused its evolution. A nectarous scent wafts from its body, luring in the bug Pokémon it preys on.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "甘い　りんごを　食べて　進化。 体から　甘い　においを　だして 餌の　虫ポケモンを　引き寄せる。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Son corps est recouvert de nectar. La peau de son dos, particulièrement sucrée, constituait jadis le goûter des enfants.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "shield",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Its body is covered in sweet nectar, and the skin on its back is especially yummy. Children used to have it as a snack.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "shield",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "甘い　蜜で　体が　おおわれ 背中の　皮は　とくに　甘く 昔は　子どもの　おやつだった。",
